    {
      "source": "Use of this wrapper allows for late check in <a href=\"#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\"><code>handleReturnValue(Object, MethodParameter, ModelAndViewContainer, NativeWebRequest)</code></a> of\nthe type of the actual body value in case the method signature does not\nprovide enough information to decide via <a href=\"#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用此包装器允许在<a href=\"#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\"><code>handleReturnValue(Object, MethodParameter, ModelAndViewContainer, NativeWebRequest)</code></a>中延迟检查实际主体值的类型，以防方法签名未提供足够的信息以便通过<a href=\"#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a>进行判断。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle the given return value by adding attributes to the model and\nsetting a view or setting the\n<a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html#setRequestHandled(boolean)\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer.setRequestHandled(boolean)</code></a> flag to <code>true</code>\nto indicate the response has been handled directly.",
      "translation": "处理给定的返回值，通过向模型添加属性并设置视图，或设置<a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html#setRequestHandled(boolean)\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer.setRequestHandled(boolean)</code></a>标志为<code>true</code>，以指示响应已被直接处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method return type</a> is\nsupported by this handler.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法返回类型</a>是否由该处理器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
