      "translation": "<a href=\"ResponseBodyEmitterReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>ResponseBodyEmitterReturnValueHandler</code></a> 用于处理响应体为 <a href=\"ResponseBodyEmitter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>ResponseBodyEmitter</code></a> 或异步/反应式类型的响应。",
      "count": 2
