    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the type of the return value. This type must have\npreviously been passed to <a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must\nhave returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 返回值的类型。此类型必须此前已传递给<a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this handler supports the supplied return type;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此处理器支持提供的返回类型；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
